{
  "type": "complete_fixed_biography_review",
  "title": "王韶之傳及子曄",
  "revision": 1996694,
  "raw_path": "sources/songshu/songshu060-ws1996694.wikitext",
  "raw_sha256": "a9b03405240b25c24c2fa2b999e921483d7c1d78a3ed6f1eb1807a289bf02a97",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "source_line": 82,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p001",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 14,
      "text": "王韶之字休泰，琅邪臨沂人也。",
      "interpretation": "傳主、字及籍貫。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 82,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p001",
      "start": 14,
      "end": 24,
      "text": "曾祖廙，晉驃騎將軍。",
      "interpretation": "曾祖王廙為晉驃騎將軍。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 82,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p001",
      "start": 24,
      "end": 32,
      "text": "祖羨之，鎮軍掾。",
      "interpretation": "祖王羨之任鎮軍掾。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 82,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p001",
      "start": 32,
      "end": 42,
      "text": "父偉之，本國郎中令。",
      "interpretation": "父偉之任本國郎中令。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 84,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p002",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 16,
      "text": "韶之家貧，父為烏程令，因居縣境。",
      "interpretation": "隨任烏程令的父親居縣境。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 84,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p002",
      "start": 16,
      "end": 25,
      "text": "好史籍，博涉多聞。",
      "interpretation": "讀史博學。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 84,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p002",
      "start": 25,
      "end": 36,
      "text": "初為衞將軍謝琰行參軍。",
      "interpretation": "入謝琰府。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 84,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p002",
      "start": 36,
      "end": 82,
      "text": "偉之少有志尚，當世詔命表奏，輒自書寫，太元、隆安時事，小大悉撰錄之，韶之因此私撰晉安帝陽秋。",
      "interpretation": "父抄詔表及時事，韶之因據以私撰晉安帝陽秋。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 84,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p002",
      "start": 82,
      "end": 111,
      "text": "既成，時人謂宜居史職，即除著作佐郎，使續後事，訖義熙九年。",
      "interpretation": "既成被薦掌史，續至義熙九年。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 84,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p002",
      "start": 111,
      "end": 126,
      "text": "善敍事，辭論可觀，為後代佳史。",
      "interpretation": "稱其敍事、辭論。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 84,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p002",
      "start": 126,
      "end": 133,
      "text": "遷尚書祠部郎。",
      "interpretation": "轉尚書祠部郎。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 84,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p002",
      "start": 133,
      "end": 177,
      "text": "晉帝自孝武以來，常居內殿，武官主書於中通呈，以省官一人管司詔誥，任在西省，因謂之西省郎。",
      "interpretation": "晉朝西省郎制度及職守由來。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 84,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p002",
      "start": 177,
      "end": 216,
      "text": "傅亮、羊徽相代〔在職，義熙十一年，高祖以韶之博學有文詞，補通直郎，〕領西省事。",
      "interpretation": "傅亮羊徽相代；義熙十一年補韶之。數位正文二十一字據南史補，殿本可核缺文。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 84,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p002",
      "start": 216,
      "end": 222,
      "text": "轉中書侍郎。",
      "interpretation": "轉中書侍郎。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 84,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p002",
      "start": 222,
      "end": 242,
      "text": "安帝之崩也，高祖使韶之與帝左右密加酖毒。",
      "interpretation": "史傳記劉裕使韶之與安帝左右加酖；晉紀另述縊。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 84,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p002",
      "start": 242,
      "end": 263,
      "text": "恭帝即位，遷黃門侍郎，領著作郎，西省如故。",
      "interpretation": "恭帝時任黃門、領著作續西省。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 84,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p002",
      "start": 263,
      "end": 273,
      "text": "凡諸詔黃，皆其辭也。",
      "interpretation": "詔文作者；黃、奏兩讀。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 31,
      "text": "高祖受禪，加驍騎將軍，本郡中正，黃門如故，西省職解，復掌宋書。",
      "interpretation": "受禪後加將軍、本郡中正，解西省職，掌宋史。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 31,
      "end": 84,
      "text": "有司奏東冶士朱道民禽三叛士，依例放遣，韶之啟曰：「尚書金部奏事如右，斯誠檢忘一時權制，懼非經國弘本之令典。",
      "interpretation": "朱道民禽三叛士案，引出韶之對權制的奏議。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 84,
      "end": 112,
      "text": "臣尋舊制，以罪補士，凡有十餘條，雖同異不紊，而輕重實殊。",
      "interpretation": "以罪補士的舊條十餘，輕重有別。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 112,
      "end": 164,
      "text": "至於詐列父母死，誣罔父母淫亂，破義反逆，此四條，實窮亂抵逆，人理必盡，雖復殊刑過制，猶不足以塞莫大之罪。",
      "interpretation": "列詐、誣、破義反逆等四條。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 164,
      "end": 199,
      "text": "既獲全首領，大造已隆，寧可復遂拔徒隸，緩帶當年，自同編戶，列齒齊民乎。",
      "interpretation": "論所得免刑已厚，反對再除徒隸籍。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 199,
      "end": 211,
      "text": "臣懼此制永行，所虧實大。",
      "interpretation": "不宜使臨時制度常行。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 211,
      "end": 233,
      "text": "方今聖化惟新，崇本棄末，一切之令，宜加詳改。",
      "interpretation": "請更改權宜規制。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 233,
      "end": 247,
      "text": "愚謂此四條不合加贖罪之恩。」",
      "interpretation": "請將四條排除贖罪。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 247,
      "end": 263,
      "text": "侍中褚淡之同韶之三條，却宜仍舊。",
      "interpretation": "褚淡之同意三條，所不同的條目未明。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 263,
      "end": 266,
      "text": "詔可。",
      "interpretation": "詔准。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 266,
      "end": 302,
      "text": "又駁員外散騎侍郎王寔之請假事曰：「伏尋舊制，羣臣家有情事，聽併急六十日。",
      "interpretation": "駁王寔之假，述舊制併急六十日。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 302,
      "end": 314,
      "text": "太元中改制，年賜假百日。",
      "interpretation": "太元以後每年假百日。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 314,
      "end": 334,
      "text": "又居在千里外，聽併請來年限，合為二百日。",
      "interpretation": "遠居千里外得併來年共二百日。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 334,
      "end": 347,
      "text": "此蓋一時之令，非經通之旨。",
      "interpretation": "韶之以為一時之令。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 347,
      "end": 370,
      "text": "會稽雖塗盈千里，未足為難，百日歸休，於事自足。",
      "interpretation": "認為會稽百日可休。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 370,
      "end": 396,
      "text": "若私理不同，便應自表陳解，豈宜名班朝列，而久淹私門。",
      "interpretation": "如別有私情應具表自陳。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 396,
      "end": 407,
      "text": "臣等參議，謂不合開許。",
      "interpretation": "臣等不主張本案照准。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 407,
      "end": 443,
      "text": "或家在河、洛及嶺、沔、漢者，道阻且長，猶宜別有條品，請付尚書詳為其制。」",
      "interpretation": "河洛、嶺、沔、漢等道阻者可另議。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 443,
      "end": 446,
      "text": "從之。",
      "interpretation": "議獲准。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 86,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 446,
      "end": 462,
      "text": "坐璽封謬誤，免黃門，事在謝晦傳。",
      "interpretation": "璽封有誤免黃門，另見謝晦傳。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 88,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 17,
      "text": "韶之為晉史，序王珣貨殖，王廞作亂。",
      "interpretation": "晉史述王珣貨殖、王廞亂。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 88,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 17,
      "end": 46,
      "text": "珣子弘，廞子華，並貴顯，韶之懼為所陷，深結徐羨之、傅亮等。",
      "interpretation": "二王子王弘、王華顯貴，韶之轉深交徐羨之、傅亮。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 88,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 46,
      "end": 60,
      "text": "少帝即位，遷侍中，驍騎如故。",
      "interpretation": "少帝即位，遷侍中。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 88,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 60,
      "end": 72,
      "text": "景平元年，出為吳興太守。",
      "interpretation": "景平元年初守；宋傳作吳興、南史作吳郡。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 88,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 72,
      "end": 89,
      "text": "羨之被誅，王弘入為相，領揚州刺史。",
      "interpretation": "徐羨之遇誅後，王弘入相領揚州。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 88,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 89,
      "end": 110,
      "text": "弘雖與韶之不絕，諸弟未相識者，皆不復往來。",
      "interpretation": "弘與韶之往來而部分弟輩疏絕。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 88,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 110,
      "end": 139,
      "text": "韶之在郡，常慮為弘所繩，夙夜勤厲，政績甚美，弘亦抑其私憾。",
      "interpretation": "韶之勤於郡政，弘抑私憾。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 88,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 139,
      "end": 145,
      "text": "太祖兩嘉之。",
      "interpretation": "宋文帝兩度嘉獎。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 88,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 145,
      "end": 162,
      "text": "在任積年，稱為良守，加秩中二千石。",
      "interpretation": "政績優，加秩中二千石。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 88,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 162,
      "end": 177,
      "text": "十年，徵為祠部尚書，加給事中。",
      "interpretation": "元嘉十年徵祠部尚書，加給事中。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 88,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 177,
      "end": 188,
      "text": "坐去郡長取送故，免官。",
      "interpretation": "因超額取送故免官。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 88,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 188,
      "end": 200,
      "text": "十二年，又出為吳興太守。",
      "interpretation": "十二年再任吳興太守。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 88,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 200,
      "end": 210,
      "text": "其年卒，時年五十六。",
      "interpretation": "同年卒，報齡五十六。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 88,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 210,
      "end": 220,
      "text": "七廟歌辭，韶之制也。",
      "interpretation": "七廟歌辭出自韶之。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 88,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 220,
      "end": 226,
      "text": "文集行於世。",
      "interpretation": "文集傳世。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 88,
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 226,
      "end": 242,
      "text": "子曄，尚書駕部外兵郎，臨賀太守。",
      "interpretation": "子王曄官尚書駕部外兵郎、臨賀太守。"
    }
  ],
