      "quote": "傅亮、羊徽相代在職。義熙十一年，宋武帝以韶之博學有文辭，補通直郎，領西省事",
      "sha256": "8fd9281c1d58e066b75c0b6cce86fff07d6e11c8ad6426459f8e0f2139a29499",
      "interpretation": "宋書方括號據南史補，此本有足句。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p002",
      "start": 222,
      "end": 227,
      "surface": "安帝之崩也",
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi024-ws1765279.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 1765279,
      "line": 139,
      "first_codepoint": 85,
      "end_codepoint": 104,
      "quote": "晉安帝之崩，武帝使韶之與帝左右密加酖毒",
      "sha256": "8fd9281c1d58e066b75c0b6cce86fff07d6e11c8ad6426459f8e0f2139a29499",
      "interpretation": "南史述酖毒。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p002",
      "start": 222,
      "end": 227,
      "surface": "安帝之崩也",
      "path": "source-evidence/song060-wang/external/ws2567072.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 2567072,
      "line": 351,
      "first_codepoint": 68,
      "end_codepoint": 80,
      "quote": "故密使王韶之縊帝而立恭帝",
      "sha256": "191bbf44a05c366e9ce2ae1556f05d317245ff0d923e97e99d5aad06c81e8794",
      "interpretation": "晉安帝紀作縊，並述劉裕所使。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p002",
      "start": 180,
      "end": 182,
      "surface": "羊徽",
      "path": "source-evidence/song060-wang/external/ws1489333.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 1489333,
      "line": 29,
      "first_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 18,
      "quote": "弟徽字敬猷，時譽多欣，位河東太守，卒",
      "sha256": "959ca26a6eea08fc5abfac457051fee11e0113d49e988678082b5eaf8520e401",
      "interpretation": "羊欣弟，字敬猷。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 249,
      "end": 252,
      "surface": "褚淡之",
      "path": "source-evidence/song060-wang/external/ws2190655.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 2190655,
      "line": 110,
      "first_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 9,
      "quote": "秀之弟淡之，字仲源",
      "sha256": "5afe94508cf8a62e351428f22721cad2eb99a309992e0eefa204456b54d327af",
      "interpretation": "褚秀之弟，字仲源，宋初侍中。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 249,
      "end": 252,
      "surface": "褚淡之",
      "path": "source-evidence/song060-wang/external/ws2190655.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 2190655,
      "line": 104,
      "first_codepoint": 26,
      "end_codepoint": 35,
      "quote": "父爽，金紫光祿大夫",
      "sha256": "5afe94508cf8a62e351428f22721cad2eb99a309992e0eefa204456b54d327af",
      "interpretation": "卷52褚家傳首明父爽。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 249,
      "end": 252,
      "surface": "褚淡之",
      "path": "source-evidence/song060-wang/external/ws1511857.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 1511857,
      "line": 21,
      "first_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 8,
      "quote": "秀之弟淡之字仲原",
      "sha256": "862bfd1fd96759a432eb04b0847f9b463f270a246acbd3c20c826e4f175e9bd7",
      "interpretation": "南史作仲原；同兄、同職足以辨同人，宋書作仲源。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p003",
      "start": 446,
      "end": 451,
      "surface": "坐璽封謬誤",
      "path": "source-evidence/song060-wang/external/ws1746033.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 1746033,
      "line": 15,
      "first_codepoint": 68,
      "end_codepoint": 104,
      "quote": "二年，坐行璽封鎮西司馬、南郡太守王華大封，而誤封北海太守球，版免晦侍中。",
      "sha256": "9ca7cb37e05e0ebcc400fb220a1f3970ddc2c0f948483f04b71ea93847a69898",
      "interpretation": "謝晦因誤封北海太守球免侍中，王韶之本傳有免黃門。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 60,
      "end": 64,
      "surface": "景平元年",
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi024-ws1765279.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 1765279,
      "line": 141,
      "first_codepoint": 55,
      "end_codepoint": 66,
      "quote": "出爲呉郡太守。羨之被誅",
      "sha256": "8fd9281c1d58e066b75c0b6cce86fff07d6e11c8ad6426459f8e0f2139a29499",
      "interpretation": "南史將第一次所守寫吳郡；後次吳興。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 188,
      "end": 191,
      "surface": "十二年",
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi024-ws1765279.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 1765279,
      "line": 141,
      "first_codepoint": 163,
      "end_codepoint": 171,
      "quote": "後爲呉興太守，卒",
      "sha256": "8fd9281c1d58e066b75c0b6cce86fff07d6e11c8ad6426459f8e0f2139a29499",
      "interpretation": "第二次郡名相合。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 226,
      "end": 228,
      "surface": "子曄",
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi024-ws1765279.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 1765279,
      "line": 143,
      "first_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 8,
      "quote": "子曄，位臨賀太守",
      "sha256": "8fd9281c1d58e066b75c0b6cce86fff07d6e11c8ad6426459f8e0f2139a29499",
      "interpretation": "同名父子及所守郡。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 72,
      "end": 76,
      "surface": "羨之被誅",
      "path": "sources/songshu/song005-ws2370105.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 2370105,
      "line": 32,
      "first_codepoint": 8,
      "end_codepoint": 23,
      "quote": "司徒、錄尚書事、揚州刺史徐羨之",
      "sha256": "a8c2b67f4b5da1596c81b26e1c1bda24b8881d6f9508c2de613fb5f2453a5cca",
      "interpretation": "宋文帝紀三年正月誅徐羨之。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-060-wangshaozhi:p004",
      "start": 210,
      "end": 214,
      "surface": "七廟歌辭",
      "path": "source-evidence/song060-wang/external/ws1748382.wikitext",
      "revision_id": 1748382,
      "line": 51,
      "first_codepoint": 43,
      "end_codepoint": 56,
      "quote": "黃門侍郎王韶之所撰哥辭七首",
      "sha256": "34193fc50136fe9c9e0aeeb76c3f1eafcece888ebb6a1440474812e088289aad",
      "interpretation": "宋書樂志所載王韶之製歌辭。"
    }
